Scope
-----
This LICENSE covers all files in this repository — logos, marks, type
specimens, color tokens, and accompanying documentation — except where a
separate license header on an individual file explicitly applies.

Permitted use
-------------
- Editorial / news reference to Etymolt (e.g., press, articles, talks),
  provided marks are reproduced unmodified and attributed to Etymolt Inc.
- Internal references in integration documentation by Etymolt customers,
  partners, and integrators with an active commercial relationship, subject
  to the brand guidelines in this repository.

Prohibited use
--------------
- Use of any Etymolt mark in a way that suggests endorsement, partnership,
  affiliation, or certification by Etymolt Inc. without prior written
  permission.
- Modification, redrawing, restyling, or recoloring of any mark.
- Use of Etymolt marks in product names, domain names, social-media
  handles, app icons, or merchandise without prior written permission.
- Use in connection with disparaging, deceptive, unlawful, or competing
  trademark-clearance products.

